==English==
[[Image:Waltdisneyco1.jpg|thumb|right|The Walt Disney Studios, the headquarters of The Walt Disney Company.]]
===Etymology===
The surname is of Norman origin from {{etyl|fro}} {{term|de|lang=fro||of, from}} + {{term|Isigny|pos=a place in [[Calvados]]|lang=fro}}.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{surname|from=Old French|dot=}} of [[Norman]] origin.
# {{rfd-sense}} {{pedlink|Walt Disney}}, a 20th century [[motion picture]] producer who founded the company by the same name, well known as the creator and first voice of animated character [[Mickey Mouse]].
# [[w:The Walt Disney Company|The Walt Disney Company]], an entertainment company, well known for producing [[animated]] [[film]]s, television series{{,}} and stage [[musical]]s and for operating [[theme park]]s.
# [[w:Walt Disney Pictures|Walt Disney Pictures]] or the former Walt Disney Productions; the Disney film banner.
# Any of the theme parks and vacation resorts operated by [[w:Walt Disney Parks and Resorts|Walt Disney Parks and Resorts]].
# The [[w:Disney Channel|Disney Channel]], a cable television network.

